<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian May c/a shows $6.3 mln surplus.</title>
<headline>Slovenian May c/a shows $6.3 mln surplus.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>					  May	 April	May 96</p>
<p>    Current account balance    +6.3	 -45.8	 -81.5</p>
<p>    Merchandise trade balance  -110	 -149	  -174</p>
<p>    Exports			   680	  753	   675</p>
<p>    Imports			   789	  902	   848</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
